01,0.001,0.001],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"In the old days, rounding up a crew was easy. You'd just go to a few dockside taverns and press-gang them. Get sailors drunk enough and when they wake up on a ship they'll believe they signed on for it.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":0.224,"end":11.424,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":41},"large":{"start":0.224,"end":11.424,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":41},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"But those were the bad old days and the bad old days are over. Now if you need to find someone desperate enough to join you for several months at sea you need to be more subtle.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":11.744,"end":20.608,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"large":{"start":11.744,"end":20.58,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":37},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"You lean against the wall and keep your ears open. Lawyers bustle past on their way in and out of the main door. You're hoping to hear a few key words about their clients. Theft, robbery, assault. All promising elements in the CV of a pirate.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":21.024,"end":33.888,"frac":0.978,"status":"ok","matched":45,"words":46},"large":{"start":21.024,"end":33.84,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":46,"words":46},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"It's not long before you hear a lawyer say to her colleague. \"He's clearly a pirate.\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":34.208,"end":38.656,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":16},"large":{"start":34.208,"end":38.656,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":16,"words":16},"differ":false},{"i":4,"text":"This is a stroke of luck. You see the man in question who indeed looks suspicious, loitering near the entrance.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":39.2,"end":44.512,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":20},"large":{"start":39.2,"end":44.512,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":20,"words":20},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[{"start":45.86,"end":47.84,"words":6,"text":"how do you approach the pirate"}],"large":[{"start":45.64,"end":47.74,"words":6,"text":"how do you approach the pirate"}]},"image":"https://creator.storycity.app/media/68f92d19b7d78_PC%20JM8_cook.png"}